msgstr "URL ទៅ​យក​ទំនេរ/រវល់"

#. i18n: file: korganizer.kcfg:554
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (FreeBusyRetrieveUser), group (FreeBusy Retrieve)
#: rc.cpp:977 rc.cpp:2287
